-- Tests of annex ה of the follow-up committee's decision of 2.11.2022
-- against the Hours of Work and Rest Law (MMS-678; the card
-- trip-units-overtime). From 1.9.2023 it pays a teacher escorting on his
-- free day 7 hours, or the activity's hours if fewer, as substitution
-- hours: 125% of the base agreement's §31 hour value, the month over 4.33 ×
-- 36 hours (imported). The units of §40(ב) of the completion agreement come
-- on top (§4.ח of the agreement of 8.9.98: "בנוסף"), 4.5 for a day out to
-- 23:00. On a free day nothing else pays the day, so the law asks for its
-- working hours up to §2's day at the regular wage and §16 on the rest
-- (l4/lib/escort-day.l4).
--
-- Which month an hour of the regular wage is measured against decides it
-- (convention instruments.regular-hour-wage). Over the hours of the full
-- position the agreement sets — §31's 155.88 — the free day falls short;
-- over the 195 hours of §3's longest week, the bound most generous to the
-- employer, it meets the law, just.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `escort-day`
IMPORT `2022-11-02_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakav_corrections-and-annex-he`
IMPORT `base-agreement-31`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

§ `בדיקות נספח ה' מול חוק שעות עבודה ומנוחה`

`the hours of the month section 31 divides by` MEANS `weeks in a month` TIMES `hours in a full week`

-- A free day out from 8:00 to 23:00: annex ה's hours and §40(ב)'s units, in
-- hours of a month of the given hours.
GIVEN `hours of the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular hours annex ה and section 40(ב) pay for a free day out to 23:00` `hours of the month` IS
    (`regular hours substitution hours pay` (`the substitution hours annex ה pays` 0 (23 MINUS 8))
         `the substitution rate` `the hours of the month section 31 divides by` `hours of the month`)
    PLUS (`regular hours activity units pay` (`escort units for an end at` 23)
              `the share of the monthly combined salary an activity unit is worth` `hours of the month`)

`annex ה and section 40(ב) pay less than the law asks for a free day out to 23:00, at section 31's hour` MEANS
    `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
        (`regular hours the law asks for an escort on a free day` 8 23)
        (`regular hours annex ה and section 40(ב) pay for a free day out to 23:00` `the hours of the month section 31 divides by`)
#ASSERT `annex ה and section 40(ב) pay less than the law asks for a free day out to 23:00, at section 31's hour`

`annex ה and section 40(ב) meet the law for a free day out to 23:00 at the 195-hour bound` MEANS
    NOT (`the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
             (`regular hours the law asks for an escort on a free day` 8 23)
             (`regular hours annex ה and section 40(ב) pay for a free day out to 23:00` `the most hours a month of section 3's longest week holds`))
#ASSERT `annex ה and section 40(ב) meet the law for a free day out to 23:00 at the 195-hour bound`

-- 7 hours at 125% and 4.5 units: 13.66 hours of §31's month, against the
-- 16.875 the law asks.
#ASSERT `regular hours annex ה and section 40(ב) pay for a free day out to 23:00` `the hours of the month section 31 divides by` LESS THAN 13.67
#ASSERT `regular hours annex ה and section 40(ב) pay for a free day out to 23:00` `the hours of the month section 31 divides by` GREATER THAN 13.66
